; OpenTape package for GeosOne DOS Installer (GDI), GPL version 2 or later.
[Setup]
Title=OpenTape Setup
Product=GeosOne OpenTape 0.1
License=1,2,3
License1=OpenTape|LICENSE.TXT
License2=Setup (GDI), OPENTAPE.EXE|GPL3.TXT
License3=wxWindows (OTAPEWIN.EXE)|WXWIN.LIC
Readme=README.TXT
DefaultDir=%BOOT%\OPENTAPE
Done=OpenTape is installed. Load an ASPITAPE-compatible driver before using it.

[Welcome]
OpenTape is a backup, restore, verify and catalogue program for SCSI tape
drives. It works with OpenASPI ASPITAP.SYS and compatible historical
ASPITAPE.SYS drivers.

This program copies OpenTape to your hard disk. It does not install a tape
driver; use the OpenASPI setup for that.

[Options]
Option=on|Add the OpenTape directory to PATH
Option=on|Install the Windows 3.1/95/98/ME frontend

[Files]
OPENTAPE.EXE
2|OTAPEWIN.EXE
README.TXT
LICENSE.TXT
GPL3.TXT
WXWIN.LIC

[Autoexec.bat]
PathAppend=1|%DIR%
